    # game/options.rpy:32
    old "\n\nA game by {a=https://campsite.bio/nomax}Nomax{/a}\n\n{u}Co-Writers:{/u}\n\n{a=https://robert-baird.sofurry.com/}Rob{/a}\n\n{a=https://televassi.sofurry.com/}Televassi{/a}\n\n{a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}Additional writing by:{/u}\n\nJäger & Rubric\n\n\n\n{u}Animations by: {/u}\n\n{a=https://twitter.com/Yesntpan}Nopan{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}Additional art by:{/u}\n\nSam Hotel Scene Artwork by: {a=https://bsky.app/profile/bananasneon.bsky.social}BananasNEon{/a}\n\nUI Character Icons by: {a=https://boosty.to/gveanel}Gvaneal{/a}\n\n\n\nA massive thanks to all our Patrons who make the continued development of this game possible in the first place! If you want to support us you can do so here: {a=https://www.patreon.com/Nomax}Patreon{/a} or {a=https://subscribestar.adult/nomax}Subscribestar{/a}\n\nA very special thanks to Envi for going through the font and fixing some kerning issues and missing characters.\n\nSpecial thanks to those who helped along the way with proofreading, playtesting, bouncing ideas off of, and all that good stuff: Birdsongchoir, Dabby, Erkhyan, Feodorath, InvokingAzure, J.N.Squire, Kira, Maru, Samaki, Spoots, Utunu, Vorell.\n\n\n\n{u}Credits for background & minor characters:{/u}\n\nThe Senate, t987-a5256-b85-zrr, Eden, Rubric, Arch, Tuuwa, Alden, Vorell, Wolfe, Scotia, Rayden Roach, Kitten 2099, Aryte\n\n\n\n{u}Special Thanks:{/u}\n\ntofurocks for the {a=https://tofurocks.itch.io/snowfall-gui}Snowfall Plugin{/a} used under {a=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/}Creative Commons 3.0 license{/a} for some of the rainy scenes.\n\nWattson for the {a=https://wattson.itch.io/renpy-auto-highlight}Auto Highlighter{/a}.\n\n\n\n{u}Music:{/u}\n\nMain Menu Theme {a=https://musopen.org/de/music/43610-sicilienne-in-e-flat-major/}Sicilienne from Maria Theresia von Paris{/a}, performed by Carola Zosi & Stefano Ligoratti. Usage under {a=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/legalcode}Creative Commons 3.0 license{/a}.\n\nJames and Wolf at the Ruins of Despair, by: {a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\nWolf playing the fife, by: {a=https://mrmandolino.itch.io/}Mando{/a}\n\n\n\n{u}Other Music by:{/u}\n\n{a=https://donat-baracsi.itch.io/}Donato Barasci{/a}\n\n{a=https://linktr.ee/magnalitymusic}Magnality{/a}"
